      "proposed_successor_input": {
        "call_locator": "d60e1bf6db7e8ec7cce9ae85a8c35a4249403c6d72712b69c5b8fcb1df3e4376",
        "component": "tome",
        "fixed_source_identity": "commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63",
        "logical_entry_identity": "7dabf45062cfda5b03b4f402071e1f9c03b00629ece6476b12d39bc8b918a9e9",
        "normalized_path": "mod-tome.lua",
        "parent_entry_revision_identity": "ea047c36a0657e519501133b15798bef74ae09817c7773a8b199353147f7b53f",
        "rules_version": "production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2",
        "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/cunning/stealth.lua",
        "source": "Enters stealth mode (power %d, based on Cunning), making you harder to detect.\n\t\tIf successful (re-checked each turn), enemies will not know exactly where you are, or may not notice you at all.\n\t\tStealth reduces your light radius to 0, increases your infravision by 3, and will not work with heavy or massive armours.\n\t\tYou cannot enter stealth if there are foes in sight within range %d%s.\n\t\tAny non-instant, non-movement action will break stealth if not otherwise specified.\n\n\t\tEnemies uncertain of your location will still make educated guesses at it.\n\t\tWhile stealthed, enemies cannot share information about your location with each other and will be delayed in telling their allies that you exist at all.",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "target_preimage_sha256": "d59ccd97528c55207013fa58ff26d35bf3bf58c1e814a30cf40ef1887e0b8024",
        "terminology_snapshot_sha256": "bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"
      },
      "rules_version": "production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2",
      "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/cunning/stealth.lua",
      "source": "Enters stealth mode (power %d, based on Cunning), making you harder to detect.\n\t\tIf successful (re-checked each turn), enemies will not know exactly where you are, or may not notice you at all.\n\t\tStealth reduces your light radius to 0, increases your infravision by 3, and will not work with heavy or massive armours.\n\t\tYou cannot enter stealth if there are foes in sight within range %d%s.\n\t\tAny non-instant, non-movement action will break stealth if not otherwise specified.\n\n\t\tEnemies uncertain of your location will still make educated guesses at it.\n\t\tWhile stealthed, enemies cannot share information about your location with each other and will be delayed in telling their allies that you exist at all.",
      "source_tag": "tformat",
      "target_preimage": "进入潜行模式（潜行点数 %d，基于灵巧），让你更难被侦测到。\n\t\t如果成功（每回合都重新检查），敌人将不会知道你在哪里，或者根本不会注意到你。\n\t\t潜行将光照半径减小至 0，增加3点夜视能力，并且不能在装备重甲或板甲时使用。\n\t\t如果敌人在半径 %d %s 内，你不能进入潜行。\n\t\t除非特别说明，任何非瞬间非移动技能均会打破潜行。\n\n\t\t即使不知道你位置的敌人，仍然会猜测你可能在的位置。\n\t\t潜行时，敌人无法彼此分享有关你所在位置的信息，并且会延迟向盟友通报你的存在。",
      "target_preimage_sha256": "d59ccd97528c55207013fa58ff26d35bf3bf58c1e814a30cf40ef1887e0b8024",
      "terminology_snapshot_sha256": "bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140",
